# Orchestrator trust anchor — baked into the appliance image at /root/.ssh/authorized_keys.
# This is the PUBLIC key of the provisioning orchestrator; its private half never leaves the
# orchestrator. Because every image carries it, every fielded appliance trusts the orchestrator
# over a key from the factory — no per-box password, ever (the whole point of the zero-touch flow).
#
# TODO(release): replace the placeholder below with the real orchestrator public key before any
# production build. Rotating it = ship a new image / push an authorized_keys update via OTA.
# Multiple lines are fine (e.g. a current + next key during rotation).
#
# ssh-ed25519 AAAA...REPLACE-WITH-ORCHESTRATOR-PUBKEY... ctrlable-orchestrator
